Z||000000||Tigger||11-21-2001||10:25 AM||||Alrighty, who wants a custom signature?         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'm probably going to get flooded with requests since mine was voted one of the coolest, but hey why not.  I'll try my best to fill all of the requests and please be patient, it may take some time for me to make them.<P>Ok, what I will need:<P>- A picture of your car(s) (Please post it here if you can).  The better the picture, the better it will turn out.  I can fix some minor over and underexposed pictures but I can't do much with very small or grainy pictures.<BR>- Let me know if you'd like your username added.<BR>- Also, if you'd like anything else added to personalize it (Like Tigger in mine for example), I'll need a picture of that as well.  Try to keep the request reasonable since I'm not sure how much time I'll have.<P>To use your signature, click the "profile" link in the upper right hand corner of this page.  Login, then add the UBB code to the signature field.  To see how the UBB code works, edit my post and you will see the code and the location of the signature image. <P>Here are a few that I've made, I kinda like this scheme.  They will look great as long as Cliff keeps the forum background blue.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wild86customsig4[1].gif">          <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue4.gif">             <BR>T-T-F-N, Ta Ta For Now!<BR><A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/tatooine/spielberg/241/" TARGET=_blank>Tigger's Fiero Page</A><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 11-23-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000001||Butter||11-21-2001||11:30 AM||||Tigger,<BR>Can you do anything with this pic   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/buttersig.gif">     <P>It's bad grainy but I like it cause the frost covered the bad paint and I liked the horse over the car in the background.<P>I know it's not much to work with.  I just thought maybe some of you signature guru’s could improve it some.  <p>[This message has been edited by Butter (edited 11-26-2001).]||||reg||1
