Z||000043||fierochild||11-25-2001||02:47 PM||||Thanks Tiger!<BR>     Love the sig. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">  The color is original custom.  I spotted the color on the Interstate Batteries race car <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> in a Nascar calender.  I took the page to Maco and told the painter to match it.  He did.  Turns out (due to printing ink) to be a shade different.  It sure turns heads everywhere I go.  I've tried to post other pics on the forum with out success. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  Using PIP to upload to fiero.nl/uploads.  PIP says upload successful.  I loading photos from my documents.  Does PIP automatically add this extention to the upload location?  Wouldn"t life be great without computer illiterates like me.  Anyway, thanks again for the sig.  At least I'll be able to show people what my car looks like. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierochildsig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
