Z||000068||RedGTFieroKCMO||12-09-2001||10:06 PM||||hey, can you make me a sig file too? You did excellent work with the others.  Putting my user name in the file too is ok. Thanks, Sean, KCMO.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>&lt;REMOVED PIC&gt;<P><BR>   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tigger:<BR><B>Alrighty, who wants a custom signature?            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'm probably going to get flooded with requests since mine was voted one of the coolest, but hey why not.  I'll try my best to fill all of the requests and please be patient, it may take some time for me to make them.<P>Ok, what I will need:<P>- A picture of your car(s) (Please post it here if you can).  The better the picture, the better it will turn out.  I can fix some minor over and underexposed pictures but I can't do much with very small or grainy pictures.<BR>- Let me know if you'd like your username added.<BR>- Also, if you'd like anything else added to personalize it (Like Tigger in mine for example), I'll need a picture of that as well.  Try to keep the request reasonable since I'm not sure how much time I'll have.<P>To use your signature, click the "profile" link in the upper right hand corner of this page.  Login, then add the UBB code to the signature field.  To see how the UBB code works, edit my post and you will see the code and the location of the signature image. <P>Here are a few that I've made, I kinda like this scheme.  They will look great as long as Cliff keeps the forum background blue.<P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wild86customsig4[1].gif">             <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>[This message has been edited by RedGTFieroKCMO (edited 12-09-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by RedGTFieroKCMO (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000069||LoW_KeY||12-09-2001||10:13 PM||||I must say kick ass!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>thanks again!!<P>-KC<P>------------------<BR>AIM: FierFormula88   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/low_keysig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000070||FieroJoe||12-09-2001||10:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroMaster88:<BR><B>Thanks Tigger!  Looks GREAT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmm, my digital camera must be the one thats a fairy.  It's always had a queer thing about reds in sunlight.  I probably gotta change the mode from indoor incandescent light to outdoor sunlight.  Hmm....<P>Anyways, sig file looks cool James!<P>Brent - I'll email you a pic of my car instead of posting it here, keep down on some of the traffic.||||reg||1
